{
  "title": "Epiphyseal bracket",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/pediatrics/12781/epiphyseal-bracket",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jun 15 2021",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Epiphyseal Bracket is a rare congenital disorder caused by the incomplete development of primary ossification centers that presents with a deformity of the hand or foot.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis is made with MRI studies with presence of a longitudinal epiphyseal bracket in the involved digit.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is usually early surgical physiolysis.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "2-14% of congenital hand and foot deformities",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "11% of all cases found in the great toe",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "affects the epiphysis of short tubular bones",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "incomplete development of primary ossification centers",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**aberrant physeal cartilage** extending along the diaphysis interferes with the normal",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "the growth of the abnormal epiphysis leads to a short, wide, **triangular or trapezoidal phalanx**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "growth disturbance due to longitudinally oriented cartilaginous bracket",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "growth follows a \"C-shaped\" curve",
              "table": null,
              "images": [
                {
                  "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/12781/images/f132-024ac-9780323081764.jpg",
                  "caption": "c-shaped"
                }
              ],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genetics",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "autosomal dominant when present in hand",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "otherwise sporadic",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Associated conditions",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Rubinstein -Taybi syndrome",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "fibrodysplasia ossificans progressiva",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**hallux varus** in feet",
              "table": null,
              "images": [
                {
                  "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/12781/images/11832_2013_544_fig2_html.jpg",
                  "caption": ""
                }
              ],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "clindodactyly and polydactyly in hands",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Apert's syndrome",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Classification",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "table": [
            {
              "header": true,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 3,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "**Radiographic Staging**",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Stage 1",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Delta shaped diaphsyis",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "Radiolucent cartilagenous epiphysis",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/12781/images/11832_2013_544_fig3_html.jpg",
                          "caption": "Staging"
                        }
                      ],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Stage 2",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Secondary ossification centers at the proximal and distal ends",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/12781/images/11832_2013_544_fig3_html.jpg",
                          "caption": "Staging"
                        }
                      ],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Stage 3",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Complete ossification of the longitudinal bracket epiphysis along one side of the diaphysis",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/12781/images/11832_2013_544_fig3_html.jpg",
                          "caption": "Staging"
                        }
                      ],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "header": false,
              "cells": [
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Stage 4",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "Closure of the physis",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "colspan": 0,
                  "bullets": [
                    {
                      "text": "",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [
                        {
                          "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/12781/images/11832_2013_544_fig3_html.jpg",
                          "caption": "Staging"
                        }
                      ],
                      "importance": "-1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Presentation",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Physical exam",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "inspection",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "notable deformity of the hand or foot",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Imaging",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Radiographs",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "recommended views",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "AP/lateral of hand or foot in question",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "findings",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "involved bone is **trapezoidal** or **triangular** in shape",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "\"D-shaped\" metatarsal",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "wedge-shaped diaphysis of the middle phalanx",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "3",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ultrasound",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "suspected pre-ossified bracket can be visualized",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "can establish the diagnosis",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MRI",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "to **diagnose longitudinal epiphyseal bracket**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Treatment",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Nonoperative",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "splinting",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "used in infancy to help loosen the soft tissues prior to surgery",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "some authors consider it not very effective",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Operative",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "osetotomies (opening or closing wedge)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "longitudinal epiphyseal bracket in older children after closure of the bracket epiphysis",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "helps to correct angulation of the involved bones",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "1",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "physiolysis + interposition (PMMA or fat)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "indications",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "1",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "early intervention allows for more correction of angulation and more longitudinal growth",
                      "table": null,
                      "images": [],
                      "importance": "5",
                      "children": []
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Techniques",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "**Surgical physiolysis**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/12781/images/11832_2013_544_fig4_html.jpg",
              "caption": "bracket resection"
            }
          ],
          "importance": "5",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "approach the bone of concern",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "mark the border of the bracket at the proximal and distal epiphyses with small gauge needle",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "check placement on fluroscopy",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "sharply resect the border of the bracket",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "protect normal epiphysis at proximal and distal ends",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Complications",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Complications with nonoperative treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "structural deformation of the forefoot",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**incomplete longitudinal growth** of affected bone",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**clinodactyly** at the interphalangeal joint",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Complications with operative treatment",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**recurrence** of deformity",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**incomplete correction** of deformity",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Prognosis",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Favorable with surgical intervention",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
